flowchart TB
  accTitle: Personal AI Digest architecture
  accDescr: A Cloudflare Worker fires a GitHub Actions workflow at 09:11 and 20:11 Eastern. The send job picks topics from a curriculum, retrieves and distills evidence from the knowledge store, and asks Ollama Cloud to write the lessons. A quality gate rejects any lesson whose factual paragraphs do not cite the evidence, and passing lessons are emailed over SMTP. A send log committed to git prevents double sends. A separate ingest job chunks, tags, and embeds sources into the store, which is SQLite or Postgres with pgvector.

  subgraph cf["CLOUDFLARE"]
    worker["`**Worker cron**
    09:11 + 20:11 ET`"]
  end

  subgraph gha["GITHUB ACTIONS"]
    send["`**Send job**
    curriculum, retrieve, distill`"]
    gate["`**Quality gate**
    claims must cite evidence`"]
    log[("`**Send log**
    committed to git, no double sends`")]
  end

  ingest["`**Ingest job**
  chunk, tag, embed`"]
  store[("`**Knowledge store**
  SQLite or pgvector`")]
  model["`**Ollama Cloud**
  drafts the lessons`"]
  inbox(["`**Inbox**
  SMTP, twice a day`"])

  worker ==>|dispatch| send
  store ==>|evidence| send
  send <==>|evidence in, draft out| model
  send ==> gate
  gate ==>|passing lessons| inbox
  gate --> log
  ingest --> store

  classDef key fill:#e6eee9,stroke:#315e55,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#192c32
  classDef ext fill:#f7f8f5,stroke:#7c8f83,color:#192c32
  classDef side fill:#f7f8f5,stroke:#b6c3ba,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#526460
  class gate key
  class model,inbox ext
